Subject: [PATCH] net: don't allow INET to be not configured
Date: Tue, 4 Sep 2012 10:44:51 -0700
Message-ID: <20120904104451.29819808@nehalam.linuxnetplumber.net>
References: <20120904171330.f6b0a922a754ba0f3acc123b@canb.auug.org.au>
	<50463941.9070703@xenotime.net>
